        "id": 151385,
        "name": "Killswitch",
        "username": "Killswitch",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-18T19:45:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metaphysician\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metaphysician:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I've assumed its going to basically be a Coming of Galactus homage.&nbsp; The main thing I wonder about is the hinted at \"new play mode\".&nbsp; Maybe the ability to swap out fallen heroes?&nbsp; Perhaps a 3+ \"sided\" villain?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>A villain with multiple modes in a game would be awesome.</p>",
