        "created_at": "2015-12-19T21:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Personally, I'm hoping to see a new version of Baron Blade involved in the finale. &nbsp;I could totally see Blade seizing some cosmic power or artifac for himself and becoming a much bigger threat than we've ever seen him as before, and it's got great comic book parallels to Doom stealing the power from the Silver Surfer and the Beyonder (I think Lex has occassionally attempted it as well). &nbsp;Plus, it'd be great for the signature villian of the game to turn into something really, really tough.</p>",
