        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-28T19:16:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ericmo32\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/5f8ce5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ericmo32:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Foote wrote:</b><br><blockquote>But those will be the last of them since SotM is rapidly approaching the end point with just a final mega expansion on the horizon&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;Does anyone have any information links on this last expansion? I've heard nothing about it, and would love to see what might be speculated or hinted at.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Search the forums for any of my \"Footenotes\" threads. The majority of them are longform considerations and theories I have had over the years that tie into who the \"big bad\" might be</p>",
