        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/ccd318/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-28T20:40:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe the Super bad will be like the video varient unlocks, you have to defeat each stage of the super villian in a special way. Also has anyone considered the special play style is maybe more than 5 hero's? A supervillian that you need 8 to 10 hero's to have a chance at.</p>",
